margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134070933.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/from-1870-to-1988-california-stocked-mountain-lakes-with-trout-for-anglers-the-fish-helped-push-yellow-legged-frogs-from-92-of-their-historic-sierra-nevada-range/articleshow/134070933.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/from-1870-to-1988-california-stocked-mountain-lakes-with-trout-for-anglers-the-fish-helped-push-yellow-legged-frogs-from-92-of-their-historic-sierra-nevada-range/articleshow/134070933.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T02:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134071117,imgsize-134420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[16-year-old uses AI to map pollution and drive countywide policy change]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134025292.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-kelly-liu-the-16-year-old-san-jose-student-who-used-ai-to-map-dirty-air-put-pollution-sensors-in-underserved-schools-and-helped-push-a-countywide-policy-change/articleshow/134025292.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-kelly-liu-the-16-year-old-san-jose-student-who-used-ai-to-map-dirty-air-put-pollution-sensors-in-underserved-schools-and-helped-push-a-countywide-policy-change/articleshow/134025292.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134025693,imgsize-63442.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Centennial Edition: Iowa press revives Ruth Suckow’s Iowa Interiors; exhibition showcases Claudia McGehee art]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133995680.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ruth Suckow's remarkable collection 'Iowa Interiors' returns in a special centennial edition, featuring captivating new illustrations by talented artist Claudia McGehee. To complement the reissue, the Hearst Center hosts an exhibition spotlighting McGehee's original artworks. This initiative not only revitalizes Suckow's literary legacy but also ensures her stories resonate with contemporary audiences, bridging Iowa's rich literary history with today's readers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1926-beekeeper-ruth-suckow-published-iowa-interiors-a-small-town-story-collection-that-made-her-nationally-known-100-years-later-a-cedar-falls-press-is-reviving-the-hard-to-find-book/articleshow/133995680.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1926-beekeeper-ruth-suckow-published-iowa-interiors-a-small-town-story-collection-that-made-her-nationally-known-100-years-later-a-cedar-falls-press-is-reviving-the-hard-to-find-book/articleshow/133995680.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T01:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133995749,imgsize-896445.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Skeleton Found In Roman Jar: archaeologists uncover 1,600-year-old victim; find hints of desperate escape]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133995252.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a remarkable excavation at Deultum, Bulgaria, archaeologists uncovered the remains of a young man entombed within a sizable storage jar. The evidence indicates he sought refuge there during a devastating attack, likely after the flames had already engulfed the area. His plight, frozen in time as the jar was later rebuilt over, provides a poignant glimpse into the terror and desperation of ancient times.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/a-man-climbed-inside-a-giant-roman-storage-jar-around-1600-years-ago-and-never-came-out-archaeologists-think-they-know-what-he-was-hiding-from/articleshow/133995252.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/a-man-climbed-inside-a-giant-roman-storage-jar-around-1600-years-ago-and-never-came-out-archaeologists-think-they-know-what-he-was-hiding-from/articleshow/133995252.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T00:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133995363,imgsize-1741162.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[11-year-old inventor builds $38 moss filter that removes up to 95% of lead]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134009516.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-nithya-tammana-the-11-year-old-new-jersey-inventor-who-built-a-sub-38-moss-filter-that-can-remove-up-to-95-of-lead-from-drinking-water/articleshow/134009516.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-nithya-tammana-the-11-year-old-new-jersey-inventor-who-built-a-sub-38-moss-filter-that-can-remove-up-to-95-of-lead-from-drinking-water/articleshow/134009516.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-13T00:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134010002,imgsize-63790.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Deer Learn To Ignore Deterrents: Human shouts scare best; habituation soon blunts effect]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133992150.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Research indicates that loud human noises and bright lights were effective in driving deer and elk away from crops, while predator sounds and dog barks didn’t have the same effect. Over a period of six weeks, these animals became accustomed to the deterrents, especially those near human activity. Researchers recommend diversifying stimuli and introducing consequences to keep these animals from adapting.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/scientists-played-human-shouts-wolf-and-cougar-calls-near-british-columbia-crop-fields-deer-fled-64-of-the-time-from-human-voices-but-quickly-learned-to-ignore-the-deterrents/articleshow/133992150.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/scientists-played-human-shouts-wolf-and-cougar-calls-near-british-columbia-crop-fields-deer-fled-64-of-the-time-from-human-voices-but-quickly-learned-to-ignore-the-deterrents/articleshow/133992150.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133992270,imgsize-1164978.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Northern Ireland is part of UK’: Nigel Farage rejects Trump’s call for united Ireland]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134149044.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/northern-ireland-is-part-of-uk-nigel-farage-rejects-trumps-call-for-united-ireland/articleshow/134149044.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/northern-ireland-is-part-of-uk-nigel-farage-rejects-trumps-call-for-united-ireland/articleshow/134149044.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:27:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134149209,imgsize-86892.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kylie Jenner sells Hidden Hills mansion for $15.3 million after listing it for $20.25 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134148447.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Reality TV star and fashion mogul Kylie Jenner has sold her 13,200-square-foot Hidden Hills mansion for $15.3 million after listing it for $20.25 million. She purchased the sprawling California property for $12.05 million in 2016, aged 19. The lavish 1.4-acre estate features eight bedrooms, eight bathrooms, a pool, spa, home theatre and multiple entertainment spaces.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/kylie-jenner-sells-hidden-hills-mansion-for-15-3-million-after-listing-it-for-20-25-million-bought-13200-square-foot-home-for-12-05-million-at-19/articleshow/134148447.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/kylie-jenner-sells-hidden-hills-mansion-for-15-3-million-after-listing-it-for-20-25-million-bought-13200-square-foot-home-for-12-05-million-at-19/articleshow/134148447.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:25:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134148930,imgsize-104248.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[WhatsApp extortion in Calgary: Woman gets threats, then gunman fires at her home; 3 charged]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134148427.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/whatsapp-extortion-in-calgary-woman-gets-threats-then-gunman-fires-at-her-home-3-charged/articleshow/134148427.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/whatsapp-extortion-in-calgary-woman-gets-threats-then-gunman-fires-at-her-home-3-charged/articleshow/134148427.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:20:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134148778,imgsize-56464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2002, a Maine mother went into labor during a 9/11 memorial; 24 years later, she reunited...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134081580.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a heartwarming twist of fate, a Maine mother, Maddie Marks, and firefighter Robert Shay Jr. have rekindled their bond nearly twenty-five years after an extraordinary roadside delivery during a 9/11 memorial service. This unexpected reunion in 2026, facilitated by mutual friends, allowed them to reflect on the emotional weight of that significant day, bringing closure and a shared sense of nostalgia for their remarkable journey.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2002-a-maine-mother-went-into-labor-during-a-9/11-memorial-24-years-later-she-reunited-with-the-firefighter-who-delivered-her-son/articleshow/134081580.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2002-a-maine-mother-went-into-labor-during-a-9/11-memorial-24-years-later-she-reunited-with-the-firefighter-who-delivered-her-son/articleshow/134081580.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:14:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134084872,imgsize-1061554.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In the 1850s, pigs brought to Santa Cruz Island became feral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134085017.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Feral pigs were eradicated from Santa Cruz Island, facilitating a resurgence in fox populations. With bald eagles no longer in the area, golden eagles preyed on the island's foxes. In response, conservationists captured the golden eagles and reintroduced the native bald eagles. A captive breeding initiative safeguarded the remaining island foxes from predators, resulting in a successful revival of the island's native wildlife and ecosystem.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-the-1850s-pigs-brought-to-santa-cruz-island-became-feral-golden-eagles-drawn-by-piglets-helped-drive-foxes-down-95-then-5036-pigs-were-removed-as-foxes-rebounded-to-1300/articleshow/134085017.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/in-the-1850s-pigs-brought-to-santa-cruz-island-became-feral-golden-eagles-drawn-by-piglets-helped-drive-foxes-down-95-then-5036-pigs-were-removed-as-foxes-rebounded-to-1300/articleshow/134085017.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T23:14:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134085466,imgsize-1789903.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From Iraq to Yemen: How Iran-linked groups are putting Saudi energy routes under pressure]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134144723.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Saudi Arabia temporarily shut its East-West oil pipeline after a drone attack. This vital energy conduit transports millions of barrels of crude oil daily. The attack has increased pressure on Iraq and raised global supply concerns. Houthi rebels in Yemen have also advanced along the Red Sea route. These events disrupt major energy and shipping routes worldwide.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/from-iraq-to-yemen-how-iran-linked-groups-are-putting-saudi-energy-routes-under-pressure/articleshow/134144723.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/from-iraq-to-yemen-how-iran-linked-groups-are-putting-saudi-energy-routes-under-pressure/articleshow/134144723.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T22:28:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134145645,imgsize-1027781.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump opens 2.93M acres at Bears Ears, Grand Staircase-Escalante to new mining claims on September 11]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134141776.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In July 2026, Donald Trump removed monument protections from about 2.93 million acres at Bears Ears and Grand Staircase-Escalante in Utah. On September 11, the excluded lands became eligible for new mining claims and certain mineral activities, following the 60-day period set by presidential proclamations. The move has drawn criticism from conservation groups and advocates.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T21:28:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134142113,imgsize-143102.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin man sentenced to 5 years in US for running $27m-tax fraud scheme, helped clients dodge taxes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134138554.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-man-sentenced-to-5-years-in-us-for-running-27m-tax-fraud-scheme-helped-clients-dodge-taxes/articleshow/134138554.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-origin-man-sentenced-to-5-years-in-us-for-running-27m-tax-fraud-scheme-helped-clients-dodge-taxes/articleshow/134138554.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T22:13:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134144906,imgsize-698627.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Do we want to deport foreign doctors? Immigration firm CEO asks if US is ready to lose medical professionals, AI engineers by removing 60-day grace period]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134144207.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/d